       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. The dose needs to be checked first.\n\n**The problem:** 1700 mg three times a day adds up to **5,100 mg/day**. The maximum daily dose of metformin is **2,550 mg/day** for immediate-release and **2,000 mg/day** for extended-release. This order is twice the immediate-release maximum and would raise the risk of serious GI side effects and lactic acidosis.\n\n**What you may have meant:**\n- **Metformin 850 mg by mouth three times daily with meals** (2,550 mg/day, the immediate-release maximum)\n- **1,700 mg/day total**, split as 850 mg twice daily with meals\n- **Something else.** Please tell me the dose, frequency and formulation (IR or ER).\n\nOnce you confirm the dose, I'll enter the order. If you really do want 1,700 mg three times daily, please confirm that and give a clinical reason, and I'll include it in the order note."
      }
